Package: flowUtilities
Title: Utility Functions for Flow Cytometry Analysis Using flowWorkspace
Version: 1.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("John", "Edgar", email="edgarjohnmichael@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: flowUtilities is an R package that simplifies flow cytometry data
    analysis by providing convenient wrapper functions and utilities for common
    tasks in the flow cytometry analysis workflow. The package builds on popular
    libraries within the Bioconductor ecosystem to streamline data import, gating,
    visualization, and statistical analysis..
